The chart containers need explicit height. Change:

FROM:
<div className="h-[300px] w-full">
  <ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height="100%">

TO:
<div className="h-[300px] w-full" style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
  <ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height={300}>

This ensures ResponsiveContainer gets the actual pixel height instead of "100%"
